# WordPress Theme (gaming-hub)

- Prefix functions with `gaming_hub_`
- Load features from `functions.php` via `require ... /inc/*.php`
- Use transients for external API/RSS cache; expose REST under `gaming-hub/v1`
- Template partials: `get_template_part( 'template-parts/slug', 'variant', array( 'key' => $value ) )`
- Escape output: `esc_html`, `esc_attr`, `esc_url`; translate with `__()` / `esc_html_e()`
- Match existing tab-indent style in surrounding files
- Bump `GAMING_HUB_VERSION` when changing enqueued CSS/JS
